# Personal Portfolio Website

## About the Project
This is my personal portfolio website, developed using HTML and CSS, to showcase my profile, technical skills, projects, and contact information.

The website serves as a professional online portfolio for internship and career opportunities.

## Features
- Clean and professional user interface
- Responsive website design
- About Me section
- Technical Skills section
- Projects showcase
- Contact information
- Simple and user-friendly navigation

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Git and GitHub
- GitHub Pages for deployment

## Project Structure

```text
my-portfolio/
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── README.md
```

## How to View the Project

Visit my live portfolio website:

**Live Demo:** https://ranodeeppal.github.io/my-portfolio/

## How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/ranodeeppal/my-portfolio.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your web browser.

